              "value": "=📊 *MindMaker OS — Monthly All Hands*\n\n*{{ $('Is Today Last Day?').item.json.monthYear }}*\n\nAgatha is running the monthly review now — KPIs, business vitals, agent scorecards, wins, misses, and next month's targets.\n\nFull exec summary will follow shortly via this channel.\n\n_All Hands run by Agatha (COO) · Ops-bot via Iris_"
